her  rate of mortality related to covet 19 so  we're trying to do the public good as  well because we are university of  illinois champaign  at his core and his founding is a public  land grant university i have an  obligation to do the public good and so  in addition to trying to stand it up  across the state with other universities  we have another strategy where i'm  trying to create this alliance  of universities leveraging my  relationship and the fact i'm chairman  of the board of the association of  public and land-grant university  242 of the finest public institutions  across the country  and my colleagues in the aau  uh the 64  uh  uh really  world-class research universities mainly  across not north america but two  institutions and uh in canada so you  might admit uh you might not be  surprised to know that the list of  institutions outside of establishing  alliance we've already gotten calls from  almost every major university you can  think of from my colleague  over at indiana to michigan to michigan  state wisconsin  uh places in new york across the globe  so this is a strategy that we're working  on to serve the public good but then  there is another piece of it that we  start up as a formal university related  organization who is  vetting this for use with government  agencies other states federal government  agencies  as well as corporate entities you can  imagine large companies that have large  workforce uh whether they are working  remotely or not there's it's kind of  hard to do all of your manufacturing  completely remotely they're interested  in getting it in their  management their office head office  facility but as well as manufacturing as  well so across the board i can't name a  sector that has not indicated interest  in this in the last 12 to 45 days and  particularly the interest really peaked  once we got our uh ua  ue uh e ua improved uh approved and let  me just add one other thing to to this i  failed to mention  but another innovation that we're  working on because we can't serve all of  these clients some of them have  different set of uses some of them have  the ability to set up their own  uh clear approved laboratories many of  our institutions do  but to serve a underserved community for  example or to serve a small university  to serve k-12 education that won't have  a clear approved lab  we are in the process of a prototype  that should be done in the next week or  so of a mobile cobit 19  laboratory and we indulge envision at  least a half dozen to a dozen to maybe  two dozen of these  being deployed
 

